Made in Japan (EP): "Made in Japan" is the debut extended play and soundtrack by American singers Bella Thorne and Zendaya, featured songs from the Walmart exclusive version of "" soundtrack.  The album was released on August 21, 2012 by Walt Disney.  "Fashion is My Kryptonite" was released as promotional single on July 20, 2012.

Contagious Love: "Contagious Love" is a song by American singers Bella Thorne and Zendaya, and from soundtrack album "".  It was released as promotional single on February 14, 2013 in United States and February 19, worldwide.

